# Two repos (Pavilion-first)

- **Pavilion (product):** `auraflux-dev/pavilion` (this workspace) → `commons-pto-demo`, `commons-site`, trials on robert-4220.  
  **Edit home for shared product** (visitor / member / staff) is **`~/pavilion`**.

- **SHMS (customer #1):** `auraflux-dev/shmspto` → treasurer `frontend` → www.shmspto.org.  
  Dedicated production wall. Receives product via **promote** from pavilion. Do **not** author new shared product here except urgent hotfixes (port back same day).

## Product ship (this repo)

```bash
node scripts/ship-pavilion.mjs --target commons-pto-demo
```

Demo ship does **not** update www.shmspto.org.

## Customer promote → SHMS (separate, intentional)

When Rob asks to update live Stone Hill from product:

```bash
node scripts/promote-to-shms.mjs
# then in ~/shmspto: node scripts/ship-stone-hill.mjs
```

**Be careful during school hours** — promote + SHMS ship touches production. Prefer off-peak unless hotfix.

Emergency hotfix on www only: edit `~/shmspto`, ship SHMS, then **same day** `sync-product-between-repos.mjs --from-shms --apply` into pavilion so product does not diverge.

